{"id": "DeVxU67xKdn", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "A demon king sent Maa Durga a MARRIAGE PROPOSAL 💍 Her reply? LEGENDARY. 🔱\n\nShumbha and Nishumbha had stolen heaven — Indra's throne, his elephant, the works. 👑\n\nThen their spies, Chanda and Munda, spotted Maa Durga on the Himalayas.\n\n“Boss, you have EVERYTHING… except HER.” 😳\n\nSo Shumbha sent her a proposal: “Marry me. Or my brother. Your choice.”\n\nMaa smiled. “Sure. One tiny condition: whoever defeats me in BATTLE, I'll marry him.” 🔥\n\nAnd then the demons started dropping!\n\n🔥 **Dhumralochana:** One divine “HUM!” And he was reduced to ashes.\n\n🦁 **60,000 demons:** Maa's lion took care of them.\n\n🖤 **Chanda and Munda:** Maa Kali emerged from Maa Durga's forehead and defeated them. That's how she earned the name **CHAMUNDA** — Chanda + Munda!\n\n🩸 **Raktabija and Nishumbha:** Defeated!\n\nFinally, Shumbha faced Maa himself.\n\n“You CHEAT!” he shouted. “You only win because you have HELP!”\n\nMaa's answer? 🔱\n\n**“I am the only one here. All these forms are ME.”**\n\nEvery goddess merged back into her. No army. No backup. Just Maa Durga — one on one.\n\nAnd she WON. 🙏🌺\n\nFrom the *Devi Mahatmya* (Durga Saptashati), chapters 5–10.\n\n📚 Want your kids to discover more stories of Maa's divine forms?\n\nThe Rishi Katha Navadurga Series — Books 1–3: Shailputri, Brahmacharini & Chandraghanta.\n\n📖 Set of 3 for ₹500 \n👉 rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n👇 Ambika, Chandika, Kaushiki or Chamunda — which name have you heard before?\n\nSave this for Navratri 📌 and share it with someone who'd love this story! 🌺\n\n#Navratri #Navratri2026 #MaaDurga #DurgaMaa #Chamunda #MaaKali #DeviMahatmya #DurgaSaptashati #JaiMataDi #HinduMythology #IndianMythology #KidsBooks #PictureBooks #RishiKatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791692001, "like_count": 31515, "comment_count": 177, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"},